<title>USA: Rough seas forecast in North Sea on Friday - WSC.</title>
<headline>Rough seas forecast in North Sea on Friday - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rough to very rough seas are forecast in the North Sea on Friday which will be hazardous to some shipping, private forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>Strong west winds of up to 40 mph (65 kph) are expected on Friday but are seen diminishing slightly on Saturday.</p>
